part.text:
We need to add sounds. Let's decide approach: Use HTML5 Audio, create audio objects for boost, collision, collect fuel, game over. We need to load audio files; but we don't have assets. Could generate simple beep using Web Audio API or use DataURI? Simpler: use Web Audio API to synthesize sounds on the fly. Add functions: playBoost, playCollision, playFuel, playGameOver. Call accordingly in update when boost used (maybe each frame? could be too many). Instead play boost sound when boost active and fuel consumption occurs (maybe each boost activation). We'll trigger on s.boosting change. Also collision/game over when gameOver set. Fuel collect when fuel cell collected.

Implement audio using AudioContext and oscillator.

We need to edit game.js to add audio initialization near top, define functions, and call them.

Let's edit file: add after const ctx etc:

const audioCtx = new (window.AudioContext || window.webkitAudioContext)();

function playTone(freq, duration){ const osc=audioCtx.createOscillator(); const gain=audioCtx.createGain(); osc.frequency.value=freq; osc.connect(gain); gain.connect(audioCtx.destination); gain.gain.setValueAtTime(0.1, audioCtx.currentTime); osc.start(); osc.stop(audioCtx.currentTime+duration); }

Define functions:

function boostSound(){ playTone(440,0.1); }

function collisionSound(){ playTone(100,0.5); }

function fuelSound(){ playTone(660,0.2); }

function gameOverSound(){ playTone(200,1); }

Now need to trigger:

When boost activated: if (s.boosting && s.fuel >0 && !prevBoosting) boostSound(); We'll need variable prevBoosting track previous frame.

Add a variable before loop: let prevBoosting = false;

In update, after determining s.boosting maybe compare.

And when collision occurs set gameOver true -> after loop break, call collisionSound() before setting gameOver? In collision loop, before state.gameOver = true; call collisionSound(); break.

Similarly for fuel collect: after s.fuel adjusted, call fuelSound();

Game over by fuel also should call gameOverSound() maybe when setting flag.

Implement these edits.

Let's edit file with multiple patches.

